WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Fusion Files: places, tabs, and a path bar

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Ctrl + A selects the sample documents

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Escape clears the current action

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Open another tab to keep two locations close

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Close the extra tab when finished; files stay in place

